/K [10]
/Pg 13 0 R
/P 285 0 R
>>
endobj
196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 464 0 R
/E (Reactions to AI vary widely, but licensors across the commons are increasingly turning to more restrictive licenses in their attempts to deter AI use. Sharing content under more restrictive terms results in a more limited pool of public resources for all of us.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
